    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideally situated along Felton Road, Boyle, this exceptional three bedroom semi detached residence enjoys a prime location within easy walking distance of the town centre and all local amenities.\nHaving been extensively modernised and thoughtfully extended throughout, this impressive home offers bright, spacious, and contemporary living accommodation, perfectly suited to modern family life. Set on a generous site, the property also benefits from a large detached garage, ample off-street parking, and well maintained outdoor space.\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious open plan kitchen, dining and living area, utility room, Wc, three generously proportioned double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, master bedroom with en-suite, a spacious modern family bathroom, and a walk-in hotpress.\nFinished to an exceptional standard, the property has undergone a complete refurbishment and benefits from new plumbing and electrical systems throughout, an energy efficient air-to-water heating system, triple glazed windows, a stylish contemporary kitchen with integrated appliances, and quality finishes throughout.\nThis truly turnkey home combines style, comfort, and energy efficiency in an excellent location, making it an ideal choice for families, first time buyers, or those seeking a home ready to move straight into. Full details and viewings strictly on request.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (8.86ft x 13.12ft) <br>Kitchen/Dining/Living Area (33.46ft x 15.75ft) <br>Utility Room (9.19ft x 12.14ft) <br>WC (3.94ft x 5.74ft) <br>Bathroom (11.81ft x 9.19ft) <br>Master Bedroom (20.34ft x 9.84ft) <br>En-suite (5.58ft x 7.22ft) <br>Bedroom 2 (10.50ft x 12.80ft) <br>Bedroom 3 (11.15ft x 11.81ft) <br>Walk in Wardrobe (8.86ft x 5.58ft) <br>Garage (34.45ft x 23.95ft) "
